<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#16263F',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 44 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 3, marginBottom: 14 }}>THE 4 RULES</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, marginBottom: 20 }}>
        下指令四要素：<br />成功率从 30% 到 90%+
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 24, marginBottom: 20 }}>
        <Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 64, color: '#8FA4B8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1 }}>30%</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA4B8', marginTop: 8 }}>乱问一通</Text>
        </Box>
        <FAIcon name='arrow-right' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 32, height: 32, marginBottom: 14 }} />
        <Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 64, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1 }}>90%+</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', marginTop: 8 }}>用对四要素</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
        同一个模型、同一个问题，<span style={{ color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>下指令的方式决定效果</span>——不是模型不行，是没交代清楚。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      {[
        { k: '做什么', d: 'What：一句话说清任务与目标', icon: 'bullseye' },
        { k: '材料', d: 'Material：给足输入与背景资料', icon: 'file-alt' },
        { k: '格式', d: 'Format：指定输出的结构与长度', icon: 'table' },
        { k: '发到哪', d: 'Where：说清结果给谁看、怎么用', icon: 'paper-plane' },
      ].map((item, idx) => (
        <Box key={idx} style={{ background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)', border: '1px solid rgba(220,231,245,0.15)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 22px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, borderRadius: 12, background: 'rgba(34,211,238,0.12)', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <FAIcon name={item.icon} style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 22, height: 22 }} />
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 4 }}>{item.k}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5' }}>{item.d}</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA4B8' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 3 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA4B8' }}>08 / 11</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
